# code-is-two-libraries — the PRIMARY (entry / closure-seed) policy library (#198).
library "Two Lib Main".

// This library declares a concept-level `code is` case feature AND chains
// cross-library to a SECOND library that ALSO declares `code is`. Both mint a
// per-policy local CodeSystem; pre-#198 they collided on one canonical url. Under
// Option B this PRIMARY (reached directly from the entry `.crl`) keeps the clean
// `<policyId>-local` CodeSystem + `<policyId>-<Layer>` identities, and the sibling
// pulled in via `use decision` is auto-disambiguated.

concept "Feature Main":
- type is Observation.
- code is `feature-main`.

decision "Main Determination":
first:
- when "Feature Main" then recommend activity "Approve".
- otherwise then use decision "Two Lib Sub"."Sub Determination".

activity "Approve":
- request CPGCommunicationRequest.
- with `approve`.
